main kaabe ki beti hoon - na chino meri chadar<br>
roro ke yahi kehti hoon - na chino meri chadar<br>
<br>
1. tukdey kardale tum ne afsoos mere qasim ke<br>
pamaal kiya wavaila sab phool bani hashim ke zinda<br>
na palatkar aaya maidan se mera asghar<br>
<br>
2. jungal mein bulakar tum ne mere bhai ko mara hai<br>
mere akber ko mara hai mere gazi ko mara hai<br>
karbal mein luta hain kunba keh doongi maa se jakar<br>
<br>
3. hurmat hai badi kabe ki khaliq ki nazar mein dekho<br>
is chadar ki hurmat bhi kaabe jaisi hai samjho<br>
kaaba hojaye be parda chin jaye agar yeh chadar<br>
<br>
4. kya azmath hai quran ki hogi yeh qabar kuch tumko<br>
quran mere is sar ka karta hai tawaf aye logon<br>
tum sab ka rehbar quran hum hain quran ke rehbar<br>
<br>
5. himmat yeh kahan thi tum mein ab jis ka dum bharte ho<br>
ek ghazi ke marne par be parda mujhe karte ho<br>
abbas mera jo hota na chinti meri chadar.<br>
<br>
6. meri nasl fida hojaye par bhai mera bachjaye<br>
meri daulat-e-jaan khojaye par bhai mera bachjaye<br>
pura na huwa yeh armaan main hogayi bekas be par<br>
<br>
7. misl-e-abbas-e-jari jab girti farsh-e-zameen par<br>
mere hath pasey gardan the nasir tha na koi yawar<br>
sar naize se bhai ka deta tha dilasa rokar<br>
<br>
8. hum hashmi ke nouhe mein andaaz-e-buka dete hai<br>
karte hain jo sunke matam hum unko dua dete hai<br>
padhta hai raza jab nouha rodeti hai meri madar